    "circle_ios_fallback_text": "Now that you've created powerful SOPs with Claude's help, it's time to get them out of the AI and into a system your team will actually use every day. The best SOP storage solution isn't necessarily the most advanced one—it's the one your team will consistently access, update, and follow. That's why we recommend starting with tools your team already knows and uses, rather than forcing them to learn an entirely new platform. The goal here is simple: transform these SOPs from interesting documents into practical, living tools that drive real improvements in how your business operates.Here are 3 options to consider:🗂️ Organizational Knowledge ManagementExamples: Notion, Coda, ClickUpUse when:Select “Duplicate” in the upper right-hand corner to create a copy in your own Notion workspace. ☁️ Shared Cloud StorageExamples: Google Drive, Microsoft OneDrive, Dropbox, BoxUse when:Tiago walks you through storing SOPs in Google Drive in this demo: ⚙️ Specialized SoftwareExamples: Process Street, Stage 3 ERP (coming)Use when:Questions?If any questions or roadblocks show up as you’re building your master prompt, we invite you to post them in the #Discussion space. ",
